      "writtenOn": "2021-07-27T23:29:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "There are four scenarios that need to be handled. \n\n1) command version \u003d\u003d 0 -- Skip cros fwid output\n2) stand-alone ec build outside of cros_sdk -- \"CROS_FWID_MISSING\"\n3) non-active image does not have cros fwid -- \"CROS_FWID_MISSING\"\n4) CONFIG_CROS_FWID_VERSION is disabled -- Skip cros fwid output\n\nAdded clause in ectool for #1. Added #2 to getversion.sh. Added #3 to system_get_cros_fwid in system.c. Keeping strlen check in ectool.c for #4 (could switch to CROS_FWID_MISSING if that makes more sense).",
      "parentUuid": "d200b46f_fe87cbdd",
